input.gd++:4:1: Shader f returns an Image, which comes back from the GPU, so it can't be @async.
 4 | @async @onthread
   | ^^^^^^
Hint: Remove @async: its task waits for the GPU, while the caller gets an Async right away. Or return a Texture2D[rf] instead: it stays on the GPU, so it can be @async.
